# The same schedule the systemd timers in collector/deploy run, in UTC.
#
# The collection round. Hourly, because Atlas filters its FTDC download by file name and an hour
# brings down no more than six do.
5 * * * *   /app/docker/entrypoint.sh run
# The check on the checker, half an hour away from the round it watches.
35 * * * *  /app/docker/entrypoint.sh watchdog
# The weekly summary, which goes out even when nothing happened.
10 8 * * 1  /app/docker/entrypoint.sh digest
